# the package directory. The root's are the only ones.
/apps/cli/README.md
/apps/cli/LICENSE.md

# An agent's worktrees. Untracked is not enough: packing reads the working
# directory rather than git, and packed a whole second copy of the repository
# from here.
.claude/

